# The worker reads the repo-root .env.local by default (single source of secrets).
# These are the variables it needs — they already live in the app's .env.local:
#
#   DIRECT_URL                  Session-mode Postgres connection (port 5432) — pg-boss
#                               REQUIRES this, NOT the 6543 transaction pooler.
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL    Supabase project URL
#   SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY   Service-role key (bypasses RLS) — server-only
#   R2_ACCOUNT_ID / R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID / R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY / R2_ENDPOINT
#   R2_BUCKET_NAME / R2_REGION
#
# Optional worker-only knobs (defaults shown):
#   APP_URL=http://localhost:3000   Base URL the PDF job's Chromium navigates to.
#   KEEP_RAW_ORIGINAL=false     Set true to retain the raw upload after sanitizing.
#   WORKER_SWEEP_INTERVAL_MS=60000   How often to re-scan for stuck 'pending' rows.
